    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246510/extras/b7121f908bda1b1a5f6b35295a0273c9.poster.avif?t=1704302072\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246510/extras/b7121f908bda1b1a5f6b35295a0273c9.webm?t=1704302072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246510/extras/b7121f908bda1b1a5f6b35295a0273c9.mp4?t=1704302072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SINGLE PLAYER CAMPAIGN</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246510/extras/9dc7c014309e4095a20f235bd38caa3a.poster.avif?t=1704302072\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246510/extras/9dc7c014309e4095a20f235bd38caa3a.webm?t=1704302072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Meet the races and characters of Planetary Strike in an action packed single player campaign. Explore a rich story where each decision you make matters and every battle you fight changes the galaxy forever.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONLINE TURN-BASED COMBAT</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246510/extras/ab730022573ada9d7931c808240bfa64.poster.avif?t=1704302072\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246510/extras/ab730022573ada9d7931c808240bfa64.webm?t=1704302072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Master six unique ship types on a circular battlefield. Command your fleet to victory by destroying the enemy's planet while protecting your own.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1v1 AND 2v2 BATTLES</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246510/extras/d335f35afa2fcf739567efb6b99556ad.poster.avif?t=1704302072\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246510/extras/d335f35afa2fcf739567efb6b99556ad.webm?t=1704302072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Brave the galaxy alone or team up with a friend. Each game mode offers unique strategies and challenges.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CASUAL AND RANKED MATCHES</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246510/extras/15955e5058bd4d73e0fe015f0569f74c.poster.avif?t=1704302072\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246510/extras/15955e5058bd4d73e0fe015f0569f74c.webm?t=1704302072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Fight your way to the top of the leaderboard in skill based ranked matches or take things easy in random skirmishes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VISUAL CUSTOMIZATIONS</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246510/extras/61d0398e812c27133fb154269c22a8b2.poster.avif?t=1704302072\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246510/extras/61d0398e812c27133fb154269c22a8b2.webm?t=1704302072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Unlock cosmetic rewards as you conquer the galaxy. Choose your ship type, thruster and weapon. Select the planet you want to colonize and the alliance you want to join. Represent yourself with a fully customizable profile.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GET PROMOTED</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246510/extras/33d8ecde6e023b5e1ab1c13faa4ba314.poster.avif?t=1704302072\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246510/extras/33d8ecde6e023b5e1ab1c13faa4ba314.webm?t=1704302072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Gain the galaxy\u2019s respect by working your way from Cadet to Cosmic Overlord. Show your strength by achieving all 100 promotions.",
