resent yourself with a fully customizable profile.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GET PROMOTED</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246510/extras/33d8ecde6e023b5e1ab1c13faa4ba314.poster.avif?t=1704302072\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246510/extras/33d8ecde6e023b5e1ab1c13faa4ba314.webm?t=1704302072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Gain the galaxy\u2019s respect by working your way from Cadet to Cosmic Overlord. Show your strength by achieving all 100 promotions.",
